<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26868" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐκαιο-λογέομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.3.12
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδικαιολογησάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Prom.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			, or 
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδικαιολογήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					31.12.8
				</span></i>
			: —<i>plead one's cause before the judge, come to
				issue with</i> a person, abs., <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Eux.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.3.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				48.10
			</span></i>: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				3.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>remonstrate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὑπὲρ τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					111.126
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				108.105
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δικαιολογοῦντες</span>”
				<i>advocates,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Apol.</u>
				12
			</span></i>.</div>
